# M2 translation gate, W2 lockstep against the golden checkpoints: svnapot
# runs a 64 KiB NAPOT mapping under Sv39. rv64si/dirty belongs to the
# rv64si suite of m2_csr.list (the generator writes one file per suite).
# Format: <suite>/<name> [budget=<cycles>] [hex=<path>] [tohost=<word index>]
directed/svnapot budget=100000 hex=test/svnapot/svnapot_test.hex
